comments.message:
Please don't duplicate this actions lookup

nlohmann::json& actions = asyncResp->res
                .jsonValue["Actions"];
actions["..."] = ...;

For the style that bmcweb uses in many places, I think this can be written like

```
                    if (!googleAuthEnabled)
                    {
                        messages::success(asyncResp->res);
                        callback(false);
                        return;
                    }
                    messages::success(asyncResp->res);
                    callback(false);
```

Since `verifyTotpCallback` is short enough, I think it is better to be inlined.

````
    verifyTotpDbusUtil(asyncResp, totp, userPath,
                       [username, req{req.copy()}](bool success) {
                       if (success)
                       {
                           // Remove existing sessions of the user
                           persistent_data::SessionStore::getInstance()
                               .removeSessionsByUsernameExceptSession(username, req.session);
                       });
```
